OL,3,AADHD charity complains about Channel 4
OL,4,Adocumentary
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ADHD charity has said it has
OL,7,Fcomplained to media regulator Ofcom
OL,8,Fabout a Channel 4 documentary that
OL,9,Fsuggested the condition is a myth.
OL,11,FThe programme, titled The Great ADHD
OL,12,FMyth?, was broadcast on Tuesday and its
OL,13,Fhost, NHS psychiatrist Dr Max
OL,14,FPemberton, concluded it was "a social
OL,15,Fconstruct, not a disorder of the
OL,16,Fbrain".
OL,18,FADHD UK filed a complaint, saying:
OL,19,F"ADHD is not a myth. It is not a social
OL,20,Fconstruct."
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
